{"id":70718,"date":"2026-10-25T19:56:05","date_gmt":"2026-10-25T19:56:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70718"},"modified":"2026-10-25T20:59:19","modified_gmt":"2026-10-25T19:59:19","slug":"trail-do-capitao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-capitao\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Capit\u00e3o 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Capit\u00e3o 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do Capit\u00e3o 2027<\/strong> (8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>30 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partida \u00fanica \u00e0s <strong>16:00<\/strong> junto ao <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Rebordosa<\/strong>, na cidade de <strong>Rebordosa<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Paredes<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Disputada ao entardecer e in\u00edcio da noite, esta prova desafia os atletas em ambiente de trail noturno de inverno.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos percorrem os trilhos florestais, single tracks e caminhos serranos das freguesias de <strong>Rebordosa<\/strong>, <strong>Vandoma<\/strong> e <strong>Baltar<\/strong>, cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico da Rota do M\u00f3vel e das colinas que emolduram o vale do rio Ferreira e o Castro de Monte Padr\u00e3o. O programa integra o <strong>Trail de 20 km<\/strong> (aproximadamente <strong>900 m D+<\/strong>, limitado a 400 vagas), o <strong>Mini-Trail de 10 km<\/strong> (aproximadamente <strong>350 m D+<\/strong>) e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> (partilhando o limite de 600 vagas). Pela hora de arranque \u00e0s 16:00, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal ou lanterna e recomenda-se o transporte de recipiente pr\u00f3prio (eco-cup), telem\u00f3vel e apito.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Grupo Desportivo da Portela<\/strong> em parceria estrat\u00e9gica com a <strong>ATAD - Amigos do Trail Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva<\/strong>, C\u00e2mara Municipal de Paredes, Junta de Freguesia de Rebordosa e Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Rebordosa, a prova garante t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, lembran\u00e7a finisher, cronometragem por chip, banhos quentes e o tradicional conv\u00edvio final com sopa, bifana e bebida. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">30 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 16:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Rebordosa (Rua da Estrada Velha, 14-34), Rebordosa, Paredes, Porto<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong>