eight: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01\/2027 a 25\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando, a que horas e onde parte o Trail do Capit\u00e3o 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail do Capit\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, dia 30 de Janeiro de 2027, com partida \u00e0s 16:00 no Pavilh\u00e3o dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Rebordosa (Rua da Estrada Velha, 14-34, 4585-411 Rebordosa, Paredes). O secretariado funciona das 10:00 \u00e0s 15:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempo limite da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento inclui o Trail de 20 km (~900 m D+, 400 vagas), o Mini-Trail de 10 km (~350 m D+) e a Caminhada de 10 km (600 vagas conjuntas nos 10 km), percorrendo trilhos de Rebordosa, Vandoma e Baltar. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 5 horas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa Fase (26 de outubro a 31 de dezembro de 2026): Trail 20 km a 16,00 \u20ac, Mini-Trail 10 km a 14,00 \u20ac e Caminhada 10 km a 13,00 \u20ac. Na 2\u00aa Fase (1 a 25 de janeiro de 2027): Trail 20 km a 18,00 \u20ac, Mini-Trail 10 km a 16,00 \u20ac e Caminhada 10 km a 14,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e que material \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a finisher, banhos de \u00e1gua quente e refei\u00e7\u00e3o final (1 sopa + 1 bifana + 1 bebida). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal ou lanterna e necess\u00e1rio levar copo\/recipiente pr\u00f3prio para os abastecimentos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Trail do Capit\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Grupo Desportivo da Portela e pela ATAD - Amigos do Trail Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva, em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Paredes, Junta de Freguesia de Rebordosa e Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Rebordosa.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail do Capit\u00e3o 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-30\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-30\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Rebordosa (Rua da Estrada Velha, 14-34), Rebordosa, Paredes\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Paredes\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail do Capit\u00e3o 2027 realiza-se a 30 de janeiro em Rebordosa, Paredes, \u00e0s 16h00: Trail 20 km, Mini-Trail 10 km e Caminhada. Consulta pre\u00e7os e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-do-capitao.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail do Capit\u00e3o 20 km\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_capitao_2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini-Trail do Capit\u00e3o 10 km\", \"price\": \"14.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_capitao_2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 10 km\", \"price\": \"13.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_capitao_2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Grupo Desportivo da Portela e ATAD - Amigos do Trail Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando, a que horas e onde parte o Trail do Capit\u00e3o 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail do Capit\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, dia 30 de Janeiro de 2027, com partida \u00e0s 16:00 no Pavilh\u00e3o dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Rebordosa (Rua da Estrada Velha, 14-34, 4585-411 Rebordosa, Paredes). O secretariado funciona das 10:00 \u00e0s 15:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempo limite da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento inclui o Trail de 20 km (~900 m D+, 400 vagas), o Mini-Trail de 10 km (~350 m D+) e a Caminhada de 10 km (600 vagas conjuntas nos 10 km), percorrendo trilhos de Rebordosa, Vandoma e Baltar. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 5 horas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na 1\u00aa Fase (26 de outubro a 31 de dezembro de 2026): Trail 20 km a 16,00 \u20ac, Mini-Trail 10 km a 14,00 \u20ac e Caminhada 10 km a 13,00 \u20ac. Na 2\u00aa Fase (1 a 25 de janeiro de 2027): Trail 20 km a 18,00 \u20ac, Mini-Trail 10 km a 16,00 \u20ac e Caminhada 10 km a 14,00 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e que material \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a finisher, banhos de \u00e1gua quente e refei\u00e7\u00e3o final (1 sopa + 1 bifana + 1 bebida). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal ou lanterna e necess\u00e1rio levar copo\/recipiente pr\u00f3prio para os abastecimentos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Trail do Capit\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Grupo Desportivo da Portela e pela ATAD - Amigos do Trail Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva, em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Paredes, Junta de Freguesia de Rebordosa e Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Rebordosa.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70719,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-70718","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-paredes-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-do-capitao-683x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70718","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_even